`main`
  - Expects two arguments
  - Initializes two buffers to zero
  - Copies the first argument into `local_60[40]` and the second into `acStack_38[36]`
  - Checks if the environment variable `LANG` exists; if it does, it compares its value to `fi` or `nl` and sets the lang variable accordingly
